  "schemaVersion": "2.0",
  "day": 35,
  "theme": "Adjective & noun + preposition",
  "pillar": "precision",
  "star": true,
  "rule_en": "Many adjectives and nouns lock onto one fixed preposition: responsible for, aware of, familiar with, capable of, dependent on, similar to, relevant to, keen on — and reason for, impact on, solution to, approach to, increase in, access to, need for, alternative to. Store the pair as one chunk, not as two separate words.",
  "rule_bn": "অনেক adjective আর noun-এর সঙ্গে একটাই নির্দিষ্ট preposition বসে: responsible for, aware of, familiar with, capable of, dependent on, similar to, relevant to, keen on; আর reason for, impact on, solution to, approach to, increase in, access to, need for, alternative to. শব্দ দুটো আলাদা নয়, একসাথে একটা চাংক হিসেবে মনে রাখো।",
